- **Complaint(s):** {{ s.ncrp_ids }}
{% if c.is_conduit %}
- **Assessment:** possible innocent holder, unwitting conduit: the account appears to have been used as a pass-through by someone else, without the holder's knowledge or connivance [SOP-5-XII]
