{% else %}
- **Assessment:** possible innocent holder, bona fide recipient: the money appears to have been received in good faith, without the holder's knowledge of or connivance in the fraud [SOP-5-XII]
- **Planned action:** {{ s.disposition }} (hold the amount only; no escalation; no STR by default)
{% endif %}

